### Why a Servo Motor?

Instead of directly modifying the fan's internal electronics, a servo
motor mechanically operates the existing regulator.

Advantages:

- Retrofit existing fans
- Avoid redesigning the fan motor
- Simple actuator control
- Easy calibration
- Maintains manual regulator concept
- Low-cost prototype

### Why a Capacitive Regulator?

A capacitive regulator was selected instead of a resistive regulator to
reduce resistive heat losses during speed control.
